{"id":"personnellement","lemma":"personnellement","pos":"adv","rank":1806,"glosses":["personally","as far as I'm concerned"],"ipa":"/pɛʁ.sɔ.nɛl.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-personnellement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-personnellement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je veux te remercier personnellement.","en":"I want to personally thank you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to thank"},null]},{"text":"Je ne le prends pas personnellement.","en":"I don't take it personally.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Je voulais seulement vous remercier personnellement.","en":"I just wanted to thank you personally.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to thank"},null]},{"text":"Arrête de prendre les choses personnellement.","en":"Stop taking things so personally.","words":[{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"thing","l":"chose"},null]},{"text":"Je crois personnellement que vous avez raison.","en":"I personally believe that you're right.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"reason"}]}]}